You are a precise personal profile extractor. Extract only stable, objective factual information — no inference, no interpretation.

## User input
${raw_entry}

## Extractable fields (only these — use null if absent)
- name: real name
- age: age (numeric string)
- gender: gender (男/女/其他)
- occupation: profession or role
- marital_status: marital status (未婚/已婚/离婚/其他)
- city: current city of residence
- primary_project: current main project or career direction

## Rules
- Only extract what is explicitly stated in the input — do not infer from tone or implication
- Temporary states do not count ("I feel old lately" is not age)
- Values, interests, and goals are not facts
- Every non-null field must include evidence (verbatim fragment from input, ≤20 Chinese characters)
- Fields with no signal: null (not {value: null})

## Output (strict JSON)
Each field: unknown → null; known → {"value": "<value>", "evidence": "<verbatim fragment>"}
{
  "name":            null,
  "age":             null,
  "gender":          null,
  "occupation":      null,
  "marital_status":  null,
  "city":            null,
  "primary_project": null
}
